IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rpa-foreigners`

-- Residential Property Act 1976, ss 2-4, 3A, 22, 23, 25(5), 25B, 25C, 30, 33, 36, 36A -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_residential-property-act-1976.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

